    "detailed_description": "<h1>Languages</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950260/extras/f42c3b88254942c47e407864d84cd9f6.avif?t=1751121728\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Jo\u0131n Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950260/extras/71f759141152e7859f5da302dccd7808.avif?t=1751121728\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After losing your family, you start living in another city, trying to hold on to life. In this city you make new friends and have sexual relationships. You can see different sequences by making choices. All characters and locations used in the game are fictional. And this game is for adults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sun City is a choice-focused, adult Visual Novel that features the following in its first chapter:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1800 static images and 6+ animated scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average playing time of 2 hours or more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intriguing mystery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 original songs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950260/extras/ef20eae313f2c5040873b23b7dc88c44.poster.avif?t=1751121728\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950260/extras/ef20eae313f2c5040873b23b7dc88c44.webm?t=1751121728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950260/extras/ef20eae313f2c5040873b23b7dc88c44.mp4?t=1751121728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
